{"text": "Long ago. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Leopard lived. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In a place called the High Veldt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The High Veldt was hot, dry, and full of sand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The grass was sandy brown. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the rocks were sandy brown, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Giraffe, the Zebra. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the other animals. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Lived there, too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They were all sandy brown. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just like the grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But the Leopard was the sandiest and brownest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Of them all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He went hunting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a hunter. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Who had a bow and arrows. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Leopard hid. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the sandy grass. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And waited quietly. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Nobody could see him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So he was very good at hunting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon the animals were too scared. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To stay on the High Veldt. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the Giraffe led them all away. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To a great forest.", "alignment": {"characters": ["L", "o", "n", "g", " ", "a", "g", "o", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "L", "e", "o", "p", "a", "r", "d", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", " ", "a", " ", "p", "l", "a", "c", "e", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "H", "i", "g", "h", " ", "V", "e", "l", "d", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "H", "i", "g", "h", " ", "V", "e", "l", "d", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "h", "o